=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Marty’s Barbershop delivers excellent service in a professional and welcoming environment. Marty is highly skilled, consistent and provides great hospitality. My Barber, Foofades is also outstanding, with great attention to detail and overall an amazing guy to talk to.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Feb 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Best barber out in Vacaville, never disappointed me every time I came in🫡💯”</blockquote><figcaption>— Jaden · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/263621_martythebarber_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I was literally walking out of my doctors appointment thinking about looking for a barber when I crossed paths with the owner. He brought me in and the vibes were amazing. Great people, amazing skills and overall amazing experience. It didn’t feel like going in to just get a cut. I got an experience.You gotta get a fresh cut from these guys.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Feb 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Viv does an amazing job! She’s thorough, detail-oriented, and listens to her clients. Every haircut I’ve gotten from her is great and grows out well between cuts!!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Kendra · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/658054_hercuts_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · May 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Thank you, Hudson for making our first experience at this barbershop and with you great! It is evident you take pride in your craft and the results show for itself. We are very satisfied with our son’s haircut by you. I definitely recommend booking with him. Thank you!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Jared always does a great job. Great attention to Detail and many years of experience. If you’re looking for a new barber,Jared is the guy. He’s been cutting my hair for over 10 years.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Bradley · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1694168_thatboy-reezy_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“He cut my haircut like how I imagined it. Takes his time and doesn’t rush. Cleanest skin mid fade in the area”</blockquote><figcaption>— Nish · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/966669_joe-big-money-lopez_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Sep 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Carlos provided a great cut along with efficient timing, I would highly recommend his services!👌🏽”</blockquote><figcaption>— Emani · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/593463_losblendzz_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“10/10 recommend this shop! Marty cuts my sons hair an always is quick, smooth and always makes my sons experience exceptional. If your not getting your hair cut here your missing out.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great haircut, Good convo &amp; Good vibes. Eli got me right. Thanks!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Alex024 · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1244424_fadezbyeli-martysbarbershop_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">सवाल-जवाब</p><h2>आपके सवालों के जवाब</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>क्या मुझे अपॉइंटमेंट चाहिए?</summary><p>आप हम में से किसी के भी साथ ऑनलाइन बुक कर सकते हैं। रविवार सिर्फ़ अपॉइंटमेंट से है, और हफ़्ते के दिनों व शनिवार को बिना अपॉइंटमेंट भी आ सकते हैं।</p></details><details><summary>कटिंग कितने की है?</summary><p>सामान्य कटिंग $40–$50 है, बार्बर पर निर्भर। मौजूदा दामों के लिए अपने बार्बर का बुकिंग पेज देखें।</p></details><details><summary>क्या बुज़ुर्गों या सेना के लिए छूट है?</summary><p>हाँ। हमारे कई बार्बर बुज़ुर्गों (65+) की कटिंग $30 में और सेना/फ़र्स्ट रिस्पॉन्डर की $35–$40 में करते हैं।</p></details><details><summary>क्या आप गर्म तौलिया शेव करते हैं?</summary><p>बिल्कुल। Marty पारंपरिक शेव $40 में, और कटिंग के साथ गर्म तौलिये वाली पारंपरिक शेव $75 में करते हैं। Viviana और Joe भी पारंपरिक उस्तरा शेव करते हैं।</p></details><details><summary>क्या आप कार्ड लेते हैं?</summary><p>हाँ, हम कार्ड लेते हैं।</p></details><details><summary>क्या Wi-Fi और व्हीलचेयर सुविधा है?</summary><p>हाँ। हमारे यहाँ मुफ़्त Wi-Fi है, और दुकान व्हीलचेयर के लिए सुलभ है।</p></details><details><summary>खुलने का समय क्या है?</summary><p>हम सोम–शुक्र सुबह 9–शाम 6 और शनि सुबह 9–दोपहर 3 खुले रहते हैं। रविवार सिर्फ़ अपॉइंटमेंट से।</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">हमसे मिलें</p>\n      <h2>समय और पता</h2>\n      <address>2611 Nut Tree Rd Ste E<br>Vacaville, CA 95687</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17076608108\">(707) 660-8108</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>सोमवार</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>मंगलवार</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>बुधवार</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>गुरुवार</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>शुक्रवार</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>शनिवार</td><td>9 AM – 3 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>रविवार</td><td>बंद</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">रविवार सिर्फ़ अपॉइंटमेंट से।</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/martysbarbershop_/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm5 5a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10zm0 2a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zm5.5-3a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3z\"/></svg><span>@martysbarbershop_</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1040320_martys-barbershop_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2v2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2V2h-2v2H9V2H7zm-2 8h14v10H5V10z\"/></svg><span>Booksy</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Marty%27s+Barbershop/@38.334085,-121.954199,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d18bfa90d17:0x87e0c0043f59cd49!8m2!3d38.334085!4d-121.954199!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"